OL,3,GNEWSAPart of A38 closed after
OL,4,Amulti-vehicle collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are at the scene
OL,7,Ffollowing a multi-vehicle collision on
OL,8,Fthe A38, police have said.
OL,10,FDevon and Cornwall Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to reports of the incident on
OL,12,Fthe road near South Brent, Devon at
OL,13,Fabout 08:10 BST on Thursday.
OL,15,FTraffic data service Inrix said the
OL,16,Feastbound lane was closed.
OL,18,FPolice said minor injuries were
OL,19,Freported and the incident was ongoing.
